at you mention it, it is a little boom shaka-laka-lacking.","nextNodeIds":[110020706,110020707]},{"nodeId":110020706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3349382398,"text":"A shaka-laka-loada what now?","nextNodeIds":[110020708]},{"nodeId":110020708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2633626950,"text":"Hehehe...","nextNodeIds":[110020709]},{"nodeId":110020709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":4067378494,"text":"Brook may be a stickler for convention, but she is a talented chef nonetheless.","nextNodeIds":[110020710]},{"nodeId":110020710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":911061102,"text":"There's no doubt she will source the fanciest-quality ingredients. To win this will take a truly mind-blowing dish...","nextNodeIds":[110020711]},{"nodeId":110020711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":3919065190,"text":"Something like sea-serpent salad, stir-fried Qingxin flower, or wild mushrooms in a rich slime jus.","nextNodeIds":[110020712]},{"nodeId":110020712,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2626933934,"text":"Urgh... a slime jus!?","nextNodeIds":[110020713]},{"nodeId":110020713,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":4201601238,"text":"Haha, I know how weird it sounds but I guarantee you it tastes incredible.","nextNodeIds":[110020714]},{"nodeId":110020714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":3324903950,"text":"I'll make some for you next time!","nextNodeIds":[110020715,110020717]},{"nodeId":110020715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":979064166,"text":"Can't wait to try it.","nextNodeIds":[110020716]},{"nodeId":110020716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":3746902262,"text":"Hee-hee, you won't be disappointed when you taste it, although it looks a teensy bit gross.","nextNodeIds":[110020719]},{"nodeId":110020719,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":3112403582,"text":"Never mind that, I've just remembered there's somewhere I never checked out last time.","nextNodeIds":[110020720]},{"nodeId":110020720,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":2365950086,"text":"My gut tells me that's where we'll hit the jackpot. Let's take a look!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110020717,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2995464806,"text":"Eh... No need.","nextNodeIds":[110020718]},{"nodeId":110020718,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"Xiangling","textMapHash":1037005918,"text":"I don't get it, what's not to love...?","nextNodeIds":[110020719]},{"nodeId":110020707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1404968230,"text":"Paimon, you understand this?","nextNodeIds":[110020708]},{"nodeId":110020703,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":728468974,"text":"Do you mean it's not impressive enough?","nextNodeIds":[110020704]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1100207,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1012"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"